{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918310/extras/gifHap.gif?t=1752033921\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">During a sleepover with your friends, you found yourself in Mama's dream! <strong><i>Mama is very hungry,</i> so it's up to you to venture out into her subconscious and find cursed objects to feed her.</strong> Be careful, though, as the curses affect you! They may induce hallucinations, spawn a new plague, or even conjure corporeal pursuers....<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918310/extras/TrailerGIF.gif?t=1752033921\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> But that's great news! Mama loves to eat curses\u2014the worse the curse, the more her love grows! (Along with her appetite) <strong>As long as Mama is satiated, her angels get to keep searching for\u00a0guns and masks that cause <u>permanent bodily changes</u>.</strong> Don't worry about Mama starving, though; she'll just eat you before that happens! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918310/extras/gifVis.gif?t=1752033921\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mama dreams of neighborhoods, sewers, endless foggy halls, inverted hanging superstructures, and a myriad of beings with ulterior motives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918310/extras/nightmare680px.gif?t=1752033921\" /></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You may come to her dreams with different people over time, but if you've met some of the dream's <i>talkers</i> before, and especially if you've emotionally impacted them, they will remember you and treat you accordingly. Not all entities will offer the goodwill of friendship, so be a good judge of character. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918310/extras/gifDead.gif?t=1752033921\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don't worry too much about death, as friends can lend a helping hand by decapitating your corpse, allowing your spirit to roll your head back to <strong>Mama's Altar</strong>. Whether alive or dead, at <strong>Mama's Altar</strong>, you can communicate with friends out in the dream via your flip phone. Moreover, you can use your <strong>Personal Computer</strong> to guide them through areas of the dream, identify hazardous locations, and alert them when Mama starts to wake up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918310/extras/PhoneAndMap680px.gif?t=1752033921\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2918310?t=1752033921","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918310/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752033921","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918310/2fd8e08513609a861e31eed4cbe4b320614a9b57/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752033921","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918310/2fd8e08513609a861e31eed4cbe4b320614a9b57/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752033921","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"Players die in cartoonishly depicted gruesome and violent ways. Monsters are gory. Statues of the female figure are present but featureless."}