u accordingly. Not all entities will offer the goodwill of friendship, so be a good judge of character. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918310/extras/gifDead.gif?t=1752033921\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don't worry too much about death, as friends can lend a helping hand by decapitating your corpse, allowing your spirit to roll your head back to <strong>Mama's Altar</strong>. Whether alive or dead, at <strong>Mama's Altar</strong>, you can communicate with friends out in the dream via your flip phone. Moreover, you can use your <strong>Personal Computer</strong> to guide them through areas of the dream, identify hazardous locations, and alert them when Mama starts to wake up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918310/extras/PhoneAndMap680px.gif?t=1752033921\" /></div></p>","developers":["itamu"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918310/90b47fae2d1f4892049c57f7bf43a39e2df816a8/header.jpg?t=1752033921","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257068669,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257068669/movie480.mp4?t=1731393036","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257068669/movie_max.mp4?t=1731393036"},"name":"Mama's Sleeping Angels Official Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.s